# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] barrel.js is dynamically imported by main.js but also statically imported by main.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] setup.js is dynamically imported by main.js but also statically imported by main.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

# Assets

## barrel.js

```js
export { value } from "./main.js";

```

## main.js

```js
// effect.js
globalThis.order = ["effect"];
const value = "effect";
// setup.js
globalThis.order.push("setup");
function setupValue() {
	return "setup";
}
// main.js
const seen = globalThis.order.join(",");
const loadSetup = () => import("./setup.js");
const loadBarrel = () => import("./barrel.js");
export { loadBarrel, loadSetup, seen, setupValue as t, value };

```

## setup.js

```js
export { t as setupValue } from "./main.js";

```
